        "number": 9,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "To Consider 1. Some verbs only admit the following verb in infinitive. 2. Some verbs only admit the following verb in gerund. 3. Other verbs work with both, infinitive and gerunds. 4. Gerunds can be found after prepositions, too. 5. Infinitives can be found after adjectives, too. 6. We can also find infinitives after nouns. E.G. I had the chance to tell her.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "To Consider 1. Some verbs only admit the following verb in infinitive. 2. Some verbs only admit the following verb in gerund. 3. Other verbs work with both, infinitive and gerunds. 4. Gerunds can be found after prepositions, too. 5. Infinitives can be found after adjectives, too. 6. We can also find infinitives after nouns. E.G. I had the chance to tell her."
        ],
